  "needs_conversion": false,
  "raw_code": "(rule!\n ;; Smear every non-zero cell DOWN to the bottom edge (in scan order, so a\n ;; lower source in the same column overwrites from its row downward).\n (for*/fold ((out g)) ((r (in-range h)) (c (in-range w)))\n   (let ((v (at g r c)))\n     (if (= v 0)\n         out\n         (paint-cells out (map (lambda (rr) (list rr c)) (range r h)) v)))))",
